# Sentry MCP (manual only)

Sentry MCP is in `.cursor/mcp.json`. **Do not call Sentry MCP tools** in general chat or on your own initiative.

Use Sentry MCP only when the user:
- invokes `@sentry-fix-issues`, or
- explicitly asks to fix/investigate a **specific** issue (URL, short ID, or pasted trace they attached in that message).

Never unprompted: `search_issues`, `list_issues`, backlog triage, or starting a fix from ambient context.
